      "text": "MEMS (Microelectromechanical Systems) integrate mechanical structures with electronics\nat the micrometer scale. NEMS (Nanoelectromechanical Systems) extend this to sub-100 nm.\nMEMS is a mature industry; NEMS is largely still research."
